傷\n買了一袋冰塊在冰敷\n老闆娘突然拿紙巾跟塑膠袋過來\n像以前學校的保健室阿姨一樣幫我弄成一個冰敷袋\n五星服務🥹店內環境也乾淨\n\n餐點的部分\n我個人感覺是台式拉麵\n但味道是好吃的，而且價格便宜\n推薦給晚上突然想吃碗麵的朋友！\n店內有飲料自助，可以裝點雪碧或蘋果汁喝\n開開心心～",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9651692590354347741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3Y0ZVeGNHcGFhbWd6VmpKa01sUnRlR3BWVmtsMFl6RndNbUZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9651692590354347741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3Y0ZVeGNHcGFhbWd6VmpKa01sUnRlR3BWVmtsMFl6RndNbUZHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9651692590354347741/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3Y0ZVeGNHcGFhbWd6VmpKa01sUnRlR3BWVmtsMFl6RndNbUZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9651692590354347741/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3Y0ZVeGNHcGFhbWd6VmpKa01sUnRlR3BWVmtsMFl6RndNbUZHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9651692590354347741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3Y0ZVeGNHcGFhbWd6VmpKa01sUnRlR3BWVmtsMFl6RndNbUZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9651692590354347741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3Y0ZVeGNHcGFhbWd6VmpKa01sUnRlR3BWVmtsMFl6RndNbUZHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,653,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwcFUxcGpaamgzVjJkMlRteGpVVkl0YzFwMmFGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xdb419e8a0965c294!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlppU1pjZjh3V2d2TmxjUVItc1p2aFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwcFUxcGpaamgzVjJkMlRteGpVVkl0YzFwMmFGRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwcFUxcGpaamgzVjJkMlRteGpVVkl0YzFwMmFGRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwcFUxcGpaamgzVjJkMlRteGpVVkl0YzFwMmFGRRILMGRpekU4ZmRpQUgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09scHBVMXBqWmpoM1YyZDJUbXhqVVZJdGMxcDJhRkUSCzBkaXpFOGZkaUFIIh